  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">선생님 자료를 활용하여<br>식물 콜라주 수업 잘하였습니다.^^<br>&#160;<br>제가 갑자기 코로나에 확진되어 없는 동안<br>대체강사님께 해당수업을 부탁드리면서<br>&#160;<br>식물을 직접 구하기는 어려워서<br>식물들도 프린트하여 잘라서 활용하도록 자료를 수정하였습니다.<br>&#160;<br>저처럼 식물을 직접 구하기 힘들어서 프린트해서 쓰실 분은 참고하시라고 올려드립니다.^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fae63606734cd93cfb831431286ad33541a670f8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/fae63606734cd93cfb831431286ad33541a670f8\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59825a45fd33d942923df0642227c7ba6d95553e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/59825a45fd33d942923df0642227c7ba6d95553e\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/08b2881d2f8ffbfd2a8e2348b8f1d184394b1c5d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/08b2881d2f8ffbfd2a8e2348b8f1d184394b1c5d\" data-origin-width=\"992\" data-origin-height=\"1403\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c636f91337ddc8cd18399c442a6d245bf6fbf0f?download\" data-file-name=\"식물콜라주.hwpx\" data-file-size=\"7256623\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwpx\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DdSQv%26dataid%3D296%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20220504105630&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4c636f91337ddc8cd18399c442a6d245bf6fbf0f')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"